cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on this template, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "vidbyte-memory: correction-driven memory for coding agents"
abstract: >-
  A GitHub template for task-specific agent memory that learns from human
  corrections. Each correction becomes a slim fact or rule, a deterministic
  test or a verifier agent, and a git commit that records how the memory
  changed. Memory is markdown, tests and git in a repository the user owns.
authors:
  - name: Vidbyte
    website: "https://vidbyte.pro"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cerredz/vidbyte-memory"
license: MIT
version: 0.2.1
date-released: "2026-10-30"
keywords:
  - agent memory
  - coding agents
  - claude code
  - agents.md
  - human feedback
  - context engineering
